-# 14. Game State
-
-A representative server-side state:
-
-```cpp
-GameState {
-    RoomCode roomCode;
-    GameStatus status;
-
-    PlayerId hostId;
-
-    std::vector<Player> players;
-
-    int currentRound;
-    int totalRounds;
-
